{"name": "Dawn of Defense", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"500\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.poster.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.webm?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a71857f9f0275181c24c7dae9fc05a1d.mp4?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mix of <strong>Tower Defense, RTS, and Roguelite</strong> progression, you fight for your tribe's survival. The <strong>Imperium Aeternum</strong>, a massive shadow empire, sends its legions to erase the North and silence its gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the <strong>Spiridun</strong>, the divine nexus of your forefathers, command your last defense: build <strong>towers </strong>and rally <strong>warriors</strong>. Hold the line against endless waves, then strike back to reclaim your lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle is a <strong>divine trial</strong>. As you fall and rise, ancient <strong>runestones </strong>awaken forgotten powers, reshaping your strategy with every run. Win the gods favor in the dawn of a new age: the <strong>Dawn of Defense</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/7ac2a6045343d4def13b156122fa4af7.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.poster.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.webm?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/e064ae6908915d91181f5bae3d3f19d8.mp4?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your homeland withers under the Empire\u2019s grip. Strike back against their strongholds, reclaim lost lands, and restore your tribe\u2019s dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/aba70197395a2cd417f326af4695b92f.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.poster.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.webm?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.mp4?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle enemies on two fronts: Defend yourself with towers and troops against enemy waves surging through the trenches, then command heroes and warriors in RTS sieges to capture new islands and enemy strongholds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/b39d088ddb6425110bfe9e2f9300a211.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/29349a5f151a8559d3ffd897d939dd6c.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon your tribe's mightiest heroes to lead your forces into battle. Each hero brings unique abilities and powers, allowing you to shape the course of battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/5340906c0410ede4adae038b6ecc68f8.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.poster.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.webm?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/a88e16a2ab66728019c8c4daa94cea77.mp4?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every captured isle becomes a foothold for your people. Raise towers, rally warriors, claim strategy resources and build an economy to sustain your defenses against the Empire's forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/ae938b21b35c4255a4c0075d29214319.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d8f6a5fa180b4bc38c5331bfcce88b6f.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face Empire warlords who challenge your defenses with unique tactics. With each run, uncover their identity, learn their patterns, and adapt your strategy to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/2fccae5828cfb00ba2a4870890d19f2d.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"350\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.poster.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.webm?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.mp4?t=1787153842\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the powers of ancient runestones and unlock upgrades for towers, warriors and economy, forging new strategies with every battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/602afab9ae616f0233f537ee6ddbb6c6.avif?t=1787153842\" width=\"1000\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each battle sharpens your tactics, unlocks new tools, and prepares you for greater challenges ahead. Rise stronger and stand ready to face the Empire\u2019s assault.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dawn of Defense blends RTS, Tower Defense, and Roguelite progression. In a last defense, lead your tribe against the Empire: Command warriors in battle, fortify defenses, and build an economy as you fight to reclaim your ancestral homeland.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/d075771dd5638ff48d2214486a183e2ffd0e8ed4/header.jpg?t=1787153842", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Tower Defense", "RTS", "Roguelite", "Strategy", "Base Building", "3D"], "developers": "6side Studio", "publishers": "6side Studio", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2781660", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 August 2025 - Request Access\n\n9 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/dkh3HmAKBa4", "first_seen": 1755554400.0, "review_rank": 1516}